    - Raise logging on `RuleName="T1003"` LSASS access — default excludes too
      many svchost variants for a detection lab.
    - Ensure EventID 11 (FileCreate) captures `C:\Windows\Tasks\*` and
      `C:\Windows\System32\Tasks\*` for the T1053.005 scheduled-task work.
    - Do not strip DNS logging (EventID 22) — it powers the living-off-the-
      land reconnaissance investigation in Sprint 4.

